It must not be described as open source or assigned an SPDX open-source license
until the relevant rights holders approve that license.

AKF_PINN upstream has no declared license in the audited local checkout.
Authorship records identify Andrea Richichi and samuelemara; Git authorship alone
does not establish exclusive ownership or permission to relicense.
See docs/PROVENANCE.md and docs/PUBLICATION_CHECKLIST.md.

ForceArtGS-generated synthetic fixtures are separately attributed in
NOTICE and tests/fixtures/README.md. The upstream Apache License 2.0 is
preserved in third_party/ForceArtGS-LICENSE.txt. No ForceArtGS source code is
included. External Python dependencies retain their own licenses.
